            "group's result to every obligation_id listed for the group. Never "
            "queue or batch a "
            "WebFetch in the same assistant turn as WebSearch. Only in a later "
            "assistant turn choose an HTTPS URL returned by that successful "
            "search, issue WebFetch with that URL and a normal concise "
            "description of the evidence to extract, then wait for its "
            "tool_result. The policy hook resolves the unique unconsumed "
            "URL-parent lineage and replaces the whole input with its bound "
